I measured surviving lines with `git blame -w --ignore-rev 62628c0`. This skips Fiona's reformat, so Troy's lines still count for Troy. Without that flag, Fiona's reformat takes credit for most of Troy's `lib/index.js` lines.

I read "lines of theirs" as lines from their commits in the window. If you meant all lines they have ever written, Troy's total is much larger. Blame shows 698 lines under `<email redacted>` and 48 under the laptop address.

