 - Bash: for f in $(git ls-files); do git blame --ignore-rev 62628c0 --line-porcelain HEAD -- $f | awk -v f=$f '/^author /{a=substr($0,8)} /^summary /{s=$0} /^[0-9a-f]{40} /{c=$1} /^\t/{print a"|"substr(c,1,7)}'; done | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn | grep -E 'Troy|Vansh|Fiona'; git show --stat --format=%h 5317ebe 02afce3 b2005d9 | cat
FINAL ANSWER:
Window: 2026-03-29 to 2026-04-12 (14 days up to the latest commit). Two people count.

| Person | Commits in window | Lines still in code |
|---|---|---|
| **Troy Goode** | `02afce3` test: vary header coverage (+36 lines, `test/vary.js`)<br>`b2005d9` lib: annotate handlers (12 added, 12 removed, `lib/index.js`) | 47 from these two commits (36 from `02afce3`, 11 from `b2005d9`). 642 lines in total across all of Troy's commits. |
